  "guide": {
    "intro": [
      "Carl Jung was a Swiss psychiatrist who began as Freud’s heir and then went his own way. He proposed that beneath personal memory lies a collective unconscious full of shared images.",
      "Individuation is his word for the lifelong work of becoming a whole person by meeting what you have split off."
    ],
